    {
      "textRaw": "ImGui 高层组件 (ImguiComponent)",
      "name": "imgui_高层组件_(imguicomponent)",
      "desc": "<!-- runtime-support:begin ImguiComponent# -->\n<!-- 本段由 generator/runtime-support.js 根据 AutoJs6 运行时覆盖矩阵生成, 不要手动修改; 数据源 ksp -->\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运行时支持</th>\n<th>Rhino</th>\n<th>Node.js 主线程</th>\n<th>Node.js Worker</th>\n<th>Bun</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>入口</td>\n<td><code>ImguiComponent</code> 对象</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>已支持 11 项</td>\n<td>不适用 11 项 (仅限 Rhino 引擎), 等价写法: <code>engines.execScript of a Rhino script that opens the window, events.broadcast between the scripts</code></td>\n<td>不适用 11 项 (仅限 Rhino 引擎), 等价写法: <code>engines.execScript of a Rhino script that opens the window, events.broadcast between the scripts</code></td>\n<td>不适用 11 项 (仅限 Rhino 引擎), 等价写法: <code>engines.execScript of a Rhino script that opens the window, events.broadcast between the scripts</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>各 API 在同一运行时中的入口, 状态与授权一致, 没有差异项.</p>\n<p>Node.js 与 Bun 的导入方式, 异步返回值与授权检查见 <a href=\"runtimeApis#执行方式\">运行时 API</a>.</p>\n<!-- runtime-support:end -->\n<p>ImguiComponent 是高层组件的共同成员, 这些组件由会话托管, 在帧内绘制, 位于渲染回调之后. 具体的组件是 <a href=\"imguiLogWindowType\">ImguiLogWindow</a>, <a href=\"imguiToastType\">ImguiToast</a>, <a href=\"imguiStatsOverlayType\">ImguiStatsOverlay</a>, <a href=\"imguiDataTableType\">ImguiDataTable</a> 与 <a href=\"imguiDialogType\">ImguiDialog</a>. 类型声明中的名称是 <code>ImGui.Component</code>.</p>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "ComponentOptions",
          "name": "componentoptions",
          "desc": "<p>每种组件都读取的选项.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>visible</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a></td>\n<td>初始是否显示, 默认 <code>true</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">ImguiComponent</p>\n\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "ComponentOptions"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] type",
          "name": "[p#]_type",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>组件类型: <code>logWindow</code>, <code>toast</code>, <code>dialog</code>, <code>statsOverlay</code> 或 <code>dataTable</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] type"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] id",
          "name": "[p#]_id",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>组件 ID, 在同类组件中唯一.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] id"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] session",
          "name": "[p#]_session",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"imguiSessionType\">ImguiSession</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>组件所属的会话.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] session"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] options",
          "name": "[p#]_options",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">Object</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>创建时的选项.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] options"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] visible",
          "name": "[p#]_visible",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>是否绘制. 赋值等同 <a href=\"#m-show\">show</a> 与 <a href=\"#m-hide\">hide</a>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] visible"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] closed",
          "name": "[p#]_closed",
