          "desc": "<p><strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>传给 <a href=\"#m-close\">close</a> 的原因, 打开期间为 <code>null</code>.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] closeReason"
        },
